WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.097 --> 00:00:02.562
- Okay, Mike.

00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:04.838
Ow!

00:00:06.748 --> 00:00:09.126
- So today we're waxing
each other's chests,

00:00:09.126 --> 00:00:11.920
because apparently I don't know
what a bad idea is anymore.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.414
- Oh my God!

00:00:13.414 --> 00:00:15.406
- We're playing a game,
it's called Wax for Wax.

00:00:15.406 --> 00:00:18.552
An expert is going to put
a strip on both of us.

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:20.304
- And he'll rip it off of me,

00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:21.764
then I'll rip it off of him.

00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:22.889
- I'm slowly starting to realize

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.933
that this is a really bad idea.

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:27.519
- I mean, how painful can
waxing really be, right?

00:00:27.519 --> 00:00:29.063
- I think the chest is very painful.

00:00:29.063 --> 00:00:30.577
It's a very sensitive area.

00:00:30.577 --> 00:00:31.606
- Right.

00:00:31.606 --> 00:00:35.318
- You may feel like your skin's
coming off as well (laughs).

00:00:37.135 --> 00:00:38.494
- How hot is the wax?

00:00:38.494 --> 00:00:39.586
- It's not that hot.

00:00:39.586 --> 00:00:41.450
- Oh, that's frikken hot!

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.617
Oh my God, that's 100 degrees.

00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:46.103
Nothing to be afraid of, honey!

00:00:46.103 --> 00:00:47.748
- Oooh!

00:00:47.748 --> 00:00:49.541
- Argh!

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:51.209
- Ahhh!
- [Mike] I'm so sorry.

00:00:51.209 --> 00:00:52.629
Oh my God.

00:00:52.629 --> 00:00:53.670
- I did that!

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:56.506
- I feel like I just killed
a small woodland creature.

00:00:56.506 --> 00:00:58.213
- Ahh, ahh you did.

00:00:58.213 --> 00:01:00.642
- It's like someone
shot me in the shoulder.

00:01:01.411 --> 00:01:03.263
People do that on their private parts?

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.201
- So, round one was--
- [Mike] Awful.

00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:06.439
- I'm running into the office to see if

00:01:06.439 --> 00:01:07.809
anyone else wants to play the game.

00:01:07.809 --> 00:01:09.853
- [Voiceover] Hey, Jared, do
you want to play Wax for Wax?

00:01:09.853 --> 00:01:11.128
- Say what?

00:01:11.128 --> 00:01:12.190
- It's so warm!

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:13.439
- [Ned] What are you guys doing?

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:15.317
Oh, it warm, oh-oh.

00:01:15.317 --> 00:01:17.152
- I'm glad neither of us are bleeding yet.

00:01:17.152 --> 00:01:18.195
- Yet?

00:01:18.195 --> 00:01:21.576
- (laughs) I don't want
to do this anymore.

00:01:21.576 --> 00:01:22.940
- It's gonna be terrible.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:25.202
- She seems like she knows
what she's doing, though.

00:01:25.202 --> 00:01:26.694
I, on the other hand...

00:01:26.694 --> 00:01:27.788
- Argh!

00:01:27.788 --> 00:01:29.289
- Ooh, man!

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:30.290
- Ah!

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.875
- [Voiceover] One, two, three!
- Argh!

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:33.043
(laughs)

00:01:33.043 --> 00:01:34.625
- Ooh, like I got bit by a tiger.

00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:35.793
- Is it bleeding?

00:01:35.793 --> 00:01:37.214
- I hate that feeling.

00:01:37.214 --> 00:01:38.173
- Five, six, seven, eight!

00:01:38.173 --> 00:01:39.508
- Ooh!

00:01:39.508 --> 00:01:41.176
- Oh-ho-ho!

00:01:41.176 --> 00:01:43.670
- God, get some! I need to pump.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.876
- Ooh my God, ow!

00:01:45.876 --> 00:01:48.275
- [Ned] Get some, wax that, right here!

00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:49.434
Do it again!

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:51.019
- Oh my God, my chest is on fire!

00:01:51.019 --> 00:01:52.771
(laughs)

00:01:52.771 --> 00:01:53.855
- You were good!

00:01:53.855 --> 00:01:54.940
- I don't feel good.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.025
- Well, Zach, I've got a
meeting to run to, so--

00:01:57.025 --> 00:01:57.943
- Great.

00:01:57.943 --> 00:01:59.486
- [All] One, two, three, (mumbles).

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:00.987
- Ready?
- No.

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:02.572
- Oh my God!

00:02:02.572 --> 00:02:03.779
- Urg!
- Aah!

00:02:03.779 --> 00:02:05.440
- I'm so sorry, argh!

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.072
(laughter)

00:02:07.072 --> 00:02:08.495
- Sure, final thoughts.

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:09.621
This was chaos.

00:02:09.621 --> 00:02:11.790
- It was weird that at the
same time, like, with each rip

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.500
there was a bit of an adrenaline rush.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.619
- I felt alive, that's what it is.

00:02:14.619 --> 00:02:15.585
- I felt alive.

00:02:15.585 --> 00:02:18.486
- I mean, I regret it.

00:02:18.486 --> 00:02:20.840
(laughter)

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.050
- [Voiceover] I definitely have to do

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:24.302
some kind of maintenance,
'cause this looks awful.

00:02:24.302 --> 00:02:25.595
I look like an idiot.

00:02:25.595 --> 00:02:27.180
- [Zach] I think I'm just
going to let mine ride.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:29.290
I'm just going to like, be
like, yeah, this is the style.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.359
- [Dimitri] Yeah, that's your summer look.

00:02:30.359 --> 00:02:31.489
- My summer look.

00:02:31.489 --> 00:02:33.645
In fact, I'm going to have
to groom to keep this going.

00:02:33.645 --> 00:02:35.991
- Oh, I hate this day.

